  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.55 Type C project",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.55 “Type C project” means major asbestos abatement involving less than 260 linear feet of RACM on pipes, 160 square feet of RACM on the surface of structures other than pipes, or 35 cubic feet of RACM on facility components where the length or area could not be measured.\n\nSource. #14467, eff 1-1-26, EXPIRES: 1-1-36",
